Package: irtihmm
Type: Package
Title: Joint Item Responses and Response Times with Infinite Hidden Markov States
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(person("IRT-iHMM", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maintainer@example.org"),
    person("Lauren", "Hoskovec", role = c("aut", "cph"),
    comment = "Original psbpHMM transition routines; see UPSTREAM.md"))
Description: Research implementation of a joint Rasch and log-response-time
    model with Gaussian copula emissions and covariate-dependent probit
    stick-breaking hidden Markov transitions. Includes finite-state reference
    inference, adaptive beam sampling and Gaussian location recovery preserving
    the original hierarchical priors. Transition routines are adapted from
    Hoskovec's psbpHMM package.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
SystemRequirements: C++17
Imports: Rcpp, stats, utils, graphics, grDevices
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), salso (>= 0.3.80)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
